    "created_at": "2017-07-11T23:10:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-07-11T23:10:11Z",
    "body": "Options if you get a DOMMatrix with non-identity values in the 3d parts:\r\n\r\n1. setTransform fails\r\n2. throw away the 3d bits and just use the 2d bits\r\n3. accept the parameter, but have drawing ignore the 3d bits\r\n\r\nI'm happy with 1 or 2.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
