    "updated_at": "2017-07-13T08:19:11Z",
    "body": "Ah thanks. 2 seems best then. If everyone is okay with that we can make progress here by writing tests and filing bugs against browsers that have different behavior. The specification change will have to wait a little bit until Simon is back from vacation.",
